All three hooks are env-gated and inert when unset: VLLM_PLE_ROW_DUMP (cherry-picked 8bc7473990), VLLM_E2_SCHED_LOG (one JSON line per scheduler update + one per freed request: blocks per KV-cache group, computed/output/cached tokens, spec tokens scheduled), VLLM_E2_MEMSTATS + VLLM_E2_MEMSTATS_DIR (per-worker daemon thread from the first execute_model: self-resetting allocator high-water segments, whole-run maxima carried). Prereg flashnext-e2-gate5-promotion-prereg-2026-09-11.
